ile in order to reach it the  other can be found at the village of the  albinorics you'll have to find albus the  albanoric who's hiding disguised as a  giant pot just roll into it and you'll  break the illusion after talking to him  albus will give you the other half of  the medallion finally you'll have to  solve the puzzle of ordinal liturgical  town located here on a map in order to  reach nikola's hailig tree work your way  down and at the prayer room site of  grace and alphael brace of the halo tree  you'll find millicent once again chat  with her and exhaust her dialogue  now you'll need to continue down raphael  until you reach the drainage channel  site of grace turn around head back up  into the rod infested portion of the  halo tree and you'll be able to find an  ulcerated tree spirit defeat this rest  at the drainage channel side of grace  again and return back to where the  ulcerated tree spirit was you'll now  find a summon sign to either help or  attack millicent help her to feed her  four sisters  [Music]  rest at a sight of grace return here and  exhaust her dialogue or back to the  drainage channel set of grace rest and  then return once again and you'll find  the unalloyed gold needle on her corpse  now it's time for the most difficult  challenge of the game you'll now have to  defeat melania blade of nicola i'm not  going to go too deeply on strategies to  defeat her but suffice to say this was  one of the only fights in the entire  game i actually felt the need to use a  spirit ash for most builds i'm going to  recommend getting your mimic tier ash to  plus 10 for this fight and she will  still be nail bitingly tough  once you've done it and you've conquered  melania you can now use your unalloyed  needle on melania's scarlet rot flower  to receive mykola's needle nikola's  needle as the description says is the  one thing that can quell the frenzied  flame within and thereby prevent you  from getting the lord of the frenzied  flame ending if you